<title>USA: U.S. Treasury balances at Fed fell on April 8.</title>
<headline>U.S. Treasury balances at Fed fell on April 8.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-04-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. Treasury balances at Federal Reserve based on Treasury Department's latest budget statement.</p>
<p>			  (BILLIONS OF DLRS)</p>
<p>				 April 8		April 7</p>
<p>Fed acct			 4.505		  5.131</p>
<p>Tax/loan note acct	  11.221		 11.060</p>
<p>Cash balance		  15.276		 16.192</p>
<p>---</p>
<p>Total public debt,</p>
<p> subject to limit	5,297.411	     5,298.359</p>
<p>---</p>
<p>Treasury said individual income tax refunds valued at $5 million were issued and $226 million of corporate refunds were issued.</p>
</text>
